# SCPN Z-Pinch Core — citation metadata
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you reference this repository, cite it as below. No release, version,
  or DOI exists yet; cite the repository state you inspected.
type: software
title: SCPN Z-Pinch Core
abstract: >-
  Governed device-family repository for the classical and sheared-flow
  Z-pinch configurations within the SCPN Reactor Systems Research Group.
  Currently architecture-only: boundary contracts, CONTROL adapter
  specification, and validation tooling, with no implemented reactor
  capability.
